WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.498 --> 00:00:02.821
- [Voiceover] Fragrant pine trees,

00:00:02.821 --> 00:00:05.760
snowy streets, spacious log cabins.

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:08.179
It's the quintessential mountain town.

00:00:08.179 --> 00:00:10.762
Welcome to Jackson Hole, China.

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:13.828
Yeah that's right, China.

00:00:15.808 --> 00:00:18.193
The town has over 1,500 homes.

00:00:18.193 --> 00:00:20.748
Most residents use this
place as a weekend getaway

00:00:20.748 --> 00:00:22.795
from the hustle and bustle of Beijing.

00:00:22.795 --> 00:00:24.905
But there's another reason they come here:

00:00:24.905 --> 00:00:28.056
a shared passion for the American West.

00:00:28.056 --> 00:00:30.506
- My name is Sonjunie.

00:00:30.506 --> 00:00:32.997
I'm from Beijing, China.

00:00:32.997 --> 00:00:34.466
- [Voiceover] He's lived
here for seven years

00:00:34.466 --> 00:00:37.028
and has fully embraced the
lifestyle of the town.

00:00:37.028 --> 00:00:37.861
- I like American film.

00:00:39.741 --> 00:00:41.964
Especially Western film.

00:00:41.964 --> 00:00:43.845
Yes, John Wayne.

00:00:43.845 --> 00:00:46.095
(laughing)

00:00:47.201 --> 00:00:49.728
- [Voiceover] There's no ski
resort in Jackson Hole, China,

00:00:49.728 --> 00:00:51.411
but they do have a church
which looks straight out

00:00:51.411 --> 00:00:54.724
of A Little House on the
Prairie, a Disney store,

00:00:54.724 --> 00:00:59.323
and a whole lot of
American-style suburban sprawl.

00:00:59.323 --> 00:01:02.258
- Many American people
come here and think:

00:01:02.258 --> 00:01:03.591
“Woah, it's a wild place!”

00:01:06.053 --> 00:01:07.752
- [Voiceover] It's a slice of Americana

00:01:07.752 --> 00:01:11.085
and only two hours Northwest of Beijing.

